{"id":"wb-7-957","name":"蒲塘桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"蒲塘桥","text":"蒲塘桥位于中国江苏省南京市溧水区洪蓝镇蒲塘村，是一座东西向横跨蒲塘河（又名老新河）的明代古桥。蒲塘桥建成于明代正德七年（1512年），为九孔不等跨石拱桥，全长91.3米，宽5.7米，是溧水区现存最大的古桥。1992年被列为南京市文物保护单位，2012年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%92%B2%E5%A1%98%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":86555301,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555301","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0a779d3405bc6f9584103faf.jpg","title":"Putang_Bridge_(P10481037).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Putang_Bridge_(P10481037).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/Putang_Bridge_%28P10481037%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"bsdjs2","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"南京市溧水区 蒲塘桥","width":320,"height":240}}